==English==

===Etymology===
Coined by [[nudist]]s, who oppose this compulsion.

===Adjective===
{{en-adj|-}}

# {{label|en|naturism}} Disallowing or discouraging nudity, thus requiring the wearing of clothes, especially [[swimsuit]]s, e.g. on beaches, as opposed to [[clothing optional]] and [[clothes free]]. [[textile|Textile]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|body negative}}
* {{l|en|clothes minded}}